<title>UK: Electrocomponents names new finance director.</title>
<headline>Electrocomponents names new finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electrocomponents Plc said finance director Robert Tomkinson is to retire in July 1997. He will be replaced by Jeffrey Hewitt, currently finance director at Unitech Plc.</p>
<p>Hewitt, who was a director at Coats Viyella before moving to Unitech, will join the Electrocomponents board on November 25.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
